    "content": "The baseline specification is ready for review:\n\n- [Specification](/work/specs/001-bookmark-manager/spec.md)\n- [Quality checklist](/work/specs/001-bookmark-manager/checklists/requirements.md)\n- Feature directory: `/work/specs/001-bookmark-manager`\n- Validation: all checklist items passed; no unresolved clarifications\n\nThe draft assumes a single-user, responsive app with bookmark CRUD, tags, search, filtering, sorting, persistence, and accessibility. Accounts, sharing, browser extensions, imports/exports, and automatic metadata are excluded from v1.\n\nPlease approve the specification or tell me what you’d like changed. I’ll create the implementation plan only after approval.",
